  "Description": "Internal helper. Renders a Geometry in the output window: polygons like [GeometryToMesh] into [VisualizeMesh], curves like [CurvesToPoints] into [DrawLines] with [DrawPoints] on the points.\n\nIts only input is connected by the editor while it renders; [GetPreviewState] tells it which overlays the output window wants and which elements are selected or hovered. For content, use [GeometryToMesh] and [DrawMesh], or [CurvesToPoints] and [DrawLines] instead.",
